# Documentation routing

`.doc/` is **local-only** (gitignored). Read listed files when they exist on disk.

Read the listed files **before** implementing (use Read tool; do not guess).

| Task | Read first |
|------|------------|
| Any code in `src/` | `.doc/architecture/architecture-reference.md` |
| Forms, API, `.env` | `.doc/forms/forms.md` |
| Legal, cookie, analytics | `.doc/forms/legal-pages-review.md`, `.doc/forms/analytics-cookies-plan.md` |
| Blog, MAX import, typograf | `.doc/blog/blog-journal-guide.md`, `.doc/blog/max-blog-import-plan.md` |
| Header, nav, mobile menu | `.doc/navigation/header-frozen.md`, `.doc/navigation/header-anchor-scroll.md`, `.doc/navigation/mobile-menu.md` |
| SEO, meta, sitemap | `.doc/seo/SEO-чек-лист.md`, `.doc/seo/technical-audit-checklist.md` |
| Content / copy strategy | `.doc/content/Контент-стратегия.md`, `.doc/content/Семантическое-ядро.md` |
| Nemo widget | `.doc/roadmaps/nemo-flights-widget-plan.md` |
| PWA | `.doc/roadmaps/pwa-plan.md` |
| Tests, CI, Lighthouse | `.doc/testing/testing-plan.md` |
| Deploy, Docker, blur prod | `.doc/deploy/notes-blur-production.md` (deploy VPS docs — local only, not in git) |
| Audit status / stage 6 | `.doc/audits/AUDIT-PLAN-STATUS.md`, `.doc/audits/audit-2026-09-full.md` |
| Refactoring scope | `.doc/roadmaps/refactoring-plan.md` |

Index: `.doc/README.md`. Agent guide: `AGENTS.md`.
